{"type":"message","id":"13bfff08","parentId":"5efc1370","timestamp":"2026-04-13T05:25:35.973Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Current time is 13:25 (1:25 PM). According to HEARTBEAT.md scan schedule:\n- 08:00 早盘扫描 - missed\n- 12:00 午盘扫描 - just passed\n- 18:00 晚盘扫描 - next\n- 22:00 夜盘扫描\n\nSince there's no signal file for 2026-04-13 yet, and it's now 13:25 which is after the 12:00 noon scan time, I should perform the noon scan tasks.\n\nBut wait - the user said \"Follow it strictly. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats.\" This suggests I should only do what HEARTBEAT.md says needs attention at this specific time.\n\nLooking at the HEARTBEAT.md tasks:\n1. 信息扫描 - check market news\n2. 信号生成 - update technical indicators, check preset signals\n3. 模拟账户 - update position prices, calculate P&L, check stop loss/take profit triggers\n4. 报告生成 - generate daily report at 22:00\n\nSince this is the noon scan time (12:00), and there's no signal file for today yet, I should perform the noon scan. But the user said \"do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats\" - meaning I should not assume I need to do the 12:00 scan just because it's past 12:00.\n\nActually, looking more carefully - the heartbeat prompt says to follow HEARTBEAT.md strictly. The schedule shows:\n- 12:00 午盘扫描\n\nIt's now 13:25, which is past 12:00. If I haven't done the noon scan yet, I should do it now.\n\nBut the portfolio last update was 2026-04-10, meaning it hasn't been updated for today. This suggests the noon scan tasks need to be done.\n\nLet me do a proper noon scan now since it's the right time window and the data is stale.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**心跳检测：需要执行午盘扫描任务**\n\n当前时间 13:25，已超过 12:00 午盘扫描时间，但尚未生成今日扫描数据。执行以下任务：\n\n### 1. 信息扫描 - 检查市场新闻"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"coze_web_search:11","name":"coze_web_search","arguments":{"query":"A股 上证指数 今日行情 4月13日","count":5,"timeRange":"1d"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"c