{"type":"message","id":"ab6f52bf","parentId":"b0435b70","timestamp":"2026-04-13T13:34:02.185Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"今天是2026年4月13日，周一。根据之前的心跳扫描，美股上周五（4月10日）收盘是：\n- 道指 +0.58% (48,185.80)\n- 标普500 +0.62% (6,824.66)\n- 纳指 +0.83% (22,822.42)\n- 连续第二日收高，纳指和标普500录得七连涨\n\n但这是4月10日的数据，现在是4月13日晚上21:33，美股应该已经开盘或收盘了。我需要搜索最新的美股数据。\n\n让我用coze_web_search搜索美股最新信息。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d870c94005d834acf1bcc226feea0","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/coze-web-search/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":1803,"output":314,"cacheRead":36864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38981,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776087238648}}
{"type":"message","id":"004c1715","parentId":"ab6f52bf","timestamp":"2026-04-13T13:34:02.191Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"019d870c94005d834acf1bcc226feea0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: coze-web-search\ndescription: Search the web using coze-coding-dev-sdk. Supports web search, image search, AI summaries, time filters, and site restrictions.\nhomepage: https://www.coze.com\nmetadata: { \"openclaw\": { \"emoji\": \"🔍\", \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"npx\"] } } }\n---\n\n# Coze Web Search\n\nSearch the web using coze-coding-dev-sdk. Returns structured results with URLs, snippets, and AI summaries.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Basic Search\n\n```bash\nnpx ts-node {baseDir}/scripts/search.ts -q \"Python programming\"\n```\n\n### With Time Filter\n\n```bash\nnpx ts-node {baseDir}/scripts/search.ts \\\n  -q \"AI news\" \\\n  --time-range 1w \\\n  --count 15\n```\n\n### Site-Specific Search\n\n```bash\nnpx ts-node {baseDir}/scripts/search.ts \\\n  -q \"Python tutorials\" \\\n  --sites \"python.org,github.com,stackoverflow.com\"\n```\n\n### Image Search\n\n```bash\nnpx ts-node {baseDir}/scripts/search.ts \\\n  -q \"mountain landscape\" \\\n  --type image \\\n  --count 20\n```\n\n### Output as Markdown\n\n```bash\nnpx ts-node {baseDir}/scripts/search.ts \\\n  -q \"machine learning\" \\\n  --format markdown\n```\n\n## Script Options\n\n| Option                    | Description                                |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `-q, --query <text>`      | Search query (required)                    |\n| `--type <type>`           | `web` or `image` (default: web)            |\n| `--count <n>`             | Number of results (default: 10)            |\n| `--time-range <range>`    | `1d`, `1w`, `1m` (web only)                |\n| `--sites <domains>`       | Comma-separated domains to include         |\n| `--block-hosts <domains>` | Comma-separated domains to exclude         |\n| `--no-summary`            | Disable AI summary                         |\n| `--need-content`          | Include full page content                  |\n| `--format <fmt>`          | `json`, `text`, `markdown` (default: text) |\n\n## Time Range\n\n| Value | Description   |\n| ----- | ------------- |\n| `1d`  | Last 24 hours |\n| `1w`  | Last week     |\n| `1m`  | Last month    |\n\n## Output Formats\n\n### Text (default)\n\n```\n============================================================\nAI SUMMARY\n============================================================\nPython is a high-level programming language...\n\n============================================================\nSEARCH RESULTS (10 items)\n============================================================\n\n[1] Python.org\n    URL: https://www.python.org\n    Source: Python Software Foundation\n    The official home of the Python Programming Language...\n```\n\n### Markdown\n\nFormatted with headers, links, and collapsible content sections.\n\n### JSON\n\nRaw API response.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Use `--time-range` for recent content\n- Use `--sites` to limit to trusted sources\n- Use `--need-content` sparingly (increases response size)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776087242189}}
